Z||000000||Blazin_Low02||10-01-2001||10:56 PM||||What color purple is on your car? That's beautiful. How much did it run you if you don't mind me askin? Thanks, any answers would be greatly appreciated.<P>------------------<BR>1986 GT<BR>4 Clicker <BR>White face gauges, blue backlighting, custom marble dash, KYB and Koni, Eibach lowering springs, CD player, Kenwood 4x10's, clarion 4x6 plates, accel coil, aceel race wires, Archie V8 hood scoop, IRM rocker scoops, 1/4 window scoops, and clear tail lights!<P>Soon to have :150 shot of NOS, and a T3 turbo install||||reg||1
